{"title": "Test Subject (Condition)", "pageid": 32876, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Test_Subject_(Condition)", "categories": ["No stack ID", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Blood Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Blood_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Test Subject</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>You have ingested <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj's</a> potion as part of an experiment.</li>\n<li>You take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">slashing</span></a> damage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_BLOODMERCHANT_EXPLOSIVEPOTION</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_BLOODMERCHANT_EXPLOSIVEPOTION+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_BLOODMERCHANT_EXPLOSIVEPOTION+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Gained after drinking the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Potion\" title=\"Mysterious Potion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Potion\" title=\"Mysterious Potion\">Mysterious Potion</a> offered by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>. Immediately lost, after which the ingester gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood\" title=\"Unstable Blood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstable Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Blood_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Generic_Blood_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood\" title=\"Unstable Blood\">Unstable Blood</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Test_Subject\">Sources of Test Subject</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Potion\" title=\"Mysterious Potion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/POT_Antidote_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Potion\" title=\"Mysterious Potion\">Mysterious Potion</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714231835\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2240/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25015/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9679/419430